    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "My father went to the new development zone to conduct business about three months ago, and won't be back for a few more days. Now, his secretary, Cronin, is responsible for everything."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Cronin is also this city's Catastrophe Messenger. When we take the data and the samples down to the City Hall, he'll be able to understand the situation."
